From 6627b174bd65d36b1f468776602bd0b2d963977a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fizban <35464167+Fiztba@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:57:38 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 47/52] Compile owned VU1 programs into optional bounded native
 blocks

Add an opt-in build-time catalog generated from an explicitly pinned owned ELF and ordered MPG metadata. Sixteen-pair native groups specialize the existing strict VU semantics and retain interpreter fallback for other programs and unsupported execution boundaries. Bind admission to the actual decoded-cache rebuild and check tracked generations at original pair boundaries, preserving callback stalls and stale-cache behavior. Generated catalogs remain in the private build directory and inputs default to empty.
